                  "to": 66.17,
                  "from": 55.13,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2843775,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So where we're standing at the moment is the entrance to a large building that was constructed in 1880 as the home of a local businessman, Alfred Palmer, of the Palmer Biscuit Factory.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 81.634995,
                  "from": 67.315,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2843808,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It was later sold and became a hall of residence for students in 1911 and a museum in 1951.",
