                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2843934,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "We run activities for children and students, such as the museum club, for which there is no charge. We do have a donation box just over there, so feel free to give whatever amount you consider appropriate. We do have a cloakroom if you'd like to leave your coats and bags somewhere. Unlike other museums, photography is allowed here, so you might like to keep your cameras with you. You might be more comfortable not carrying around heavy rucksacks, though keep your coats and jackets on as it's quite cold in the museum garden today.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2843935,
