          {
            "id": 2844062,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "I'd like to tell you about the different areas of the museum. Just inside and outside the main gallery, we have an area called 4 seasons. Here, you can watch a four minute animation of a woodland scene. It was designed especially for the museum by a group of young people on a film studies course, and it's beautiful. Children absolutely love it, but then so do adults.",
