                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2844136,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "The main gallery is called Town and Country. It includes a photographic collection of prize winning sheep and shepherds. Leaving Town and Country, you enter Farmhouse Kitchen, which is, well, self explanatory. Here, we have the oldest collection of equipment for making butter and cheese in the country. And this morning, a specialist cheesemaker will be giving demonstrations of how it's produced.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2844137,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The main gallery is called Town and Country.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 263.315,
                  "from": 260.035,
