              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2844204,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "You may even get to try some. After that, you can go in two directions. To the right is a staircase that takes you up to a landing from where you can look down on the galleries. To the left is a room called a Year On The Farm. There is lots of seating here as sometimes we use the room for school visits, so it's a good place to stop for a rest.",
