            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2844349,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "The carts are old and fragile, so we ask you to keep your children close to you and ensure they don't climb on the carts. From wagon walk, you can either make your way back to reception or go out into the garden, or even go back to take another look in the galleries. In the far corner of the garden is Bees Our Magic, but we're redeveloping this area, so you can't visit that at the moment. You can still buy our honey in the shop, though. Finally, there's the pond, which contains all kinds of interesting wildlife.",
